two years at SWAT would pad my resume,

575
00:34:44,039 --> 00:34:45,960
and I'd go straight into the Political Department.

576
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:49,360
If I can't go back to the Municipal Bureau,

577
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:55,920
I'll be stuck at SWAT forever.

578
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:01,960
Dealing with Liao Bufan undermining me every day.

579
00:35:02,519 --> 00:35:03,599
And those young guys...

580
00:35:03,599 --> 00:35:04,039
It's like

581
00:35:04,639 --> 00:35:06,239
playing whack-a-mole with them.

582
00:35:09,199 --> 00:35:10,920
At my age, if I don't get promoted,

583
00:35:11,119 --> 00:35:12,000
it's essentially a demotion.

584
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:14,360
If you don't strive for the top,

585
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:15,400
you'll be

586
00:35:15,719 --> 00:35:16,599
swept away by the current.

587
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:19,639
My future was so bright.

588
00:35:20,280 --> 00:35:22,639
How did I play such a good hand so poorly?

589
00:35:22,880 --> 00:35:23,440
Tell me,

590
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:25,039
I want to work hard!

591
00:35:25,119 --> 00:35:26,679
I want to advance and succeed!

592
00:35:26,920 --> 00:35:28,239
Why is it so hard?

593
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:33,400
No, I have to keep trying.

594
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:34,679
I must work hard.

595
00:35:36,639 --> 00:35:37,679
Only when I establish myself

596
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,280
will my wife look good.

597
00:35:43,079 --> 00:35:43,639
Tan Yan.

598
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,400
Can you ever change

599
00:35:46,239 --> 00:35:47,800
your self-centered habits?

600
00:35:48,679 --> 00:35:50,440
I brought up separating under 24 hours ago,

601
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:52,239
and from the moment you walked in,

602
00:35:52,559 --> 00:35:54,519
all you think about is Chief Guo, SWAT,

603
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:55,800
and your future.

604
00:35:57,599 --> 00:35:58,920
Isn't my future our future?

605
00:35:58,920 --> 00:36:00,000
That's your future.

606
00:36:00,039 --> 00:36:01,480
How did it become my future?

607
00:36:01,840 --> 00:36:03,119
I work so hard to advance

608
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:06,079
for our future together!

609
00:36:07,159 --> 00:36:09,000
I haven't forgotten our little goals.

610
00:36:09,239 --> 00:36:10,320
Do you even care about "us"?

611
00:36:13,039 --> 00:36:14,039
Of course I do!

612
00:36:14,039 --> 00:36:15,079
Don't give me that

613
00:36:15,079 --> 00:36:16,199
"we are a part of each other" nonsense.

614
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:18,320
Eat it yourself.

615
00:36:28,840 --> 00:36:29,400
Go home.

616
00:36:30,639 --> 00:36:31,599
I still have the night shift.

617
00:36:32,360 --> 00:36:32,920
I'm hungry.

618
00:36:33,599 --> 00:36:34,239
Buy me dinner.

619
00:36:37,599 --> 00:36:39,199
Let me cool off by myself.

620
00:36:40,039 --> 00:36:40,599
Okay?

621
00:36:46,199 --> 00:36:46,760
Fine.

622
00:36:48,199 --> 00:36:49,480
I need to cool off too.

623
00:36:51,920 --> 00:36:52,639
Let's both cool off.

624
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:55,440
Cool off long enough, and it's over.

625
00:37:22,199 --> 00:37:22,599
Hello.

626
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:23,800
I'm from Gurong Police Station.

627
00:37:24,239 --> 00:37:26,079
You called saying you were looking for the one who saved...

628
00:37:26,840 --> 00:37:27,960
You're the one who brought...

629
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,360
...the drowning mother and son here, right?

630
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:30,000
Yes, that's me.

631
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,400
Have you contacted their family?

632
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:32,320
We did,

633
00:37:32,960 --> 00:37:34,119
but no one has shown up yet.

634
00:37:35,599 --> 00:37:36,280
Don't make a sound.

635
00:37:36,519 --> 00:37:37,679
Come out. Come out now.

636
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,559
Hurry up.

637
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:41,000
Look at him.

638
00:37:41,599 --> 00:37:42,400
He's been like this since he woke up.

639
00:37:43,079 --> 00:37:43,880
He won't eat properly,

640
00:37:44,159 --> 00:37:45,159
and makes a fuss all day long.

641
00:37:45,559 --> 00:37:46,280
He won't let anyone touch him.

642
00:37:46,400 --> 00:37:46,679
Come on.

643
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:48,199
Hurry up.

644
00:37:48,199 --> 00:37:49,039
Is he a little...

645
00:37:49,559 --> 00:37:50,119
...abnormal?

646
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:55,599
Intellectually disabled.

647
00:37:56,159 --> 00:37:56,960
He's in his thirties,

648
00:37:57,159 --> 00:37:58,000
but acts like a child.

649
00:37:58,599 --> 00:37:59,440
He can't speak clearly,

650
00:37:59,760 --> 00:38:00,519
and has a terrible temper.

651
00:38:01,159 --> 00:38:01,400
He...

652
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:02,440
doesn't just have a bad temper.

653
00:38:02,440 --> 00:38:03,320
He also hits people.

654
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:04,360
Look how he scratched me.

655
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:04,960
Stop!

656
00:38:05,159 --> 00:38:05,599
Come out!

657
00:38:05,599 --> 00:38:06,360
Give it to me!

658
00:38:06,360 --> 00:38:06,800
What about his mother?

659
00:38:08,239 --> 00:38:09,480
His mother is even more difficult.

660
00:38:10,559 --> 00:38:11,320
The poor lady

661
00:38:11,360 --> 00:38:12,239
has been awake for days,

662
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:13,199
but hasn't said a single word.

663
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:15,119
As for her condition,

664
00:38:15,239 --> 00:38:16,039
it's even more complicated.

665
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:17,800
We don't know what to do, either.

666
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:18,440
Wait a minute.

667
00:38:18,719 --> 00:38:20,199
What do you mean by complicated?

668
00:38:21,039 --> 00:38:21,840
Terminal cancer.

669
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:36,639
Ma'am, don't you remember me?

670
00:38:38,719 --> 00:38:40,440
I'm the one who rescued you both the other day.

671
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:49,559
If you have any difficulties or needs,

672
00:38:49,559 --> 00:38:50,360
you can just tell me.

673
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:52,559
I'll ask my superiors how we can help.

674
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:58,880
Even if you won't think of yourself,

675
00:39:00,079 --> 00:39:01,320
you still have to think of Dai Mingming.

676
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:08,719
Why did you save us?

677
00:39:11,719 --> 00:39:13,159
Why did you save us?

678
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:16,480
Why?

679
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:29,960
We checked her medical records.

680
00:39:30,280 --> 00:39:31,400
She was diagnosed half a year ago.

681
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:33,199
But she hasn't received any treatment.

682
00:39:38,360 --> 00:39:39,599
I clearly fell down first!

683
00:39:40,599 --> 00:39:41,840
And you still dared to hit me!

684
00:39:41,840 --> 00:39:42,679
Stop fighting!

685
00:39:43,199 --> 00:39:43,920
Don't hit back!

686
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:45,320
No fighting in the police station, sir!

687
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:46,320
Calm down! Calm down!

688
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:47,280
Use your words.

689
00:39:47,280 --> 00:39:48,079
Stop arguing!

690
00:39:49,679 --> 00:39:50,519
Notify their families.

691
00:39:51,039 --> 00:39:52,079
Get the injured evaluated.

692
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:53,280
Bring the uninjured ones inside.

693
00:39:54,079 --> 00:39:54,440
Got it.

694
00:39:55,440 --> 00:39:56,400
Chief Ji. Chief Ji.

695
00:39:56,840 --> 00:39:58,079
I have a situation to report.

696
00:39:58,360 --> 00:39:58,840
What is it?

697
00:39:59,039 --> 00:40:00,039
I just went to the hospital.

698
00:40:00,440 --> 00:40:02,320
Dai Mingming has an intellectual disability.

699
00:40:03,039 --> 00:40:04,000
Who's Dai Mingming?

700
00:40:04,079 --> 00:40:05,559
Dai Mingming is the son from the pair...

701
00:40:05,559 --> 00:40:07,360
...he rescued from the river, right?

702
00:40:07,519 --> 00:40:09,159
Get to the point. Get to the point.

703
00:40:09,159 --> 00:40:10,360
Then Zhi helped me check their background.

704
00:40:10,360 --> 00:40:12,760
The mother and son live alone.

705
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:13,400
They only have each other.

706
00:40:14,440 --> 00:40:15,280
I just think...

707
00:40:15,599 --> 00:40:17,519
...them falling into the river wasn't an accident.

708
00:40:17,679 --> 00:40:18,360
It was suicide.

709
00:40:23,639 --> 00:40:24,599
What makes you say that?

710
00:40:26,920 --> 00:40:28,519
Not only did his mother not thank me,

711
00:40:28,639 --> 00:40:30,119
she even blamed me for saving their lives.

712
00:40:31,199 --> 00:40:32,519
I thought about it carefully.

713
00:40:33,599 --> 00:40:34,960
A terminally ill mother...

714
00:40:34,960 --> 00:40:36,960
...with an intellectually disabled son...

715
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:37,559
...must have been driven to desperation.

716
00:40:37,559 --> 00:40:38,599
So she probably just...

717
00:40:39,920 --> 00:40:40,480
Terminal illness?

718
00:40:45,639 --> 00:40:46,880
The mother might have been attempting suicide,

719
00:40:47,599 --> 00:40:48,559
but the son might not have.

720
00:40:49,559 --> 00:40:51,239
You and Li Zhi need to get the facts straight...

721
00:40:51,599 --> 00:40:52,199
...before jumping to conclusions.

722
00:40:58,559 --> 00:40:58,840
Zhi.

723
00:41:01,119 --> 00:41:02,079
What did Chief Ji mean?

724
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:04,760
She meant exactly what she said.

725
00:41:06,039 --> 00:41:07,840
Since Dai Mingming has an intellectual disability,

726
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:08,199
right?

727
00:41:08,639 --> 00:41:09,480
So we...

728
00:41:09,679 --> 00:41:11,599
...can't say his suicide was voluntary.

729
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:12,320
Right?

730
00:41:14,119 --> 00:41:14,760
Another thing.

731
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:16,559
Yunsheng,

732
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:17,719
when you're working on a case,

733
00:41:17,719 --> 00:41:19,360
don't be so impulsive, okay?

734
00:41:19,880 --> 00:41:20,719
You're a bit too reckless.

735
00:41:22,000 --> 00:41:23,079
Working here is quite different...

736
00:41:23,079 --> 00:41:24,400
...from the SWAT team.

737
00:41:25,039 --> 00:41:26,159
You'll figure it out over time.

738
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:29,320
You see all walks of life at the police station.

739
00:41:30,920 --> 00:41:31,679
Some people...

740
00:41:32,920 --> 00:41:33,760
...love their children deeply.

741
00:41:35,159 --> 00:41:36,039
While others...

742
00:41:38,199 --> 00:41:38,719
Zhi.

743
00:41:39,159 --> 00:41:39,880
About me being reckless...

744
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:42,920
If Dai Mingming was pushed into the water...

745
00:41:43,679 --> 00:41:45,760
...does my heroic act still count?

746
00:41:47,679 --> 00:41:49,159
Yunsheng, can you focus on something else?

747
00:41:49,159 --> 00:41:50,079
It counts. It definitely counts.

748
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:51,800
Not only is it a heroic act,

749
00:41:51,800 --> 00:41:52,519
it also counts as...

750
00:41:53,239 --> 00:41:55,480
...finding a key clue in a murder case.

751
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:56,800
That's two merits.

752
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:58,000
How awesome is that?

753
00:41:58,840 --> 00:41:59,960
Your luck is just unbelievable.

754
00:42:11,480 --> 00:42:13,480
Boss, have you seen this person?

755
00:42:15,159 --> 00:42:15,880
What's your business here?

756
00:42:17,280 --> 00:42:18,519
We're just here looking for someone.

757
00:42:19,079 --> 00:42:19,840
She's my sister-in-law.

758
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:20,840
She had a fight with my brother

759
00:42:20,840 --> 00:42:22,159
and ran away with the kid.

760
00:42:23,760 --> 00:42:24,320
Let me see.

761
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:28,559
Isn't this the one from downstairs

762
00:42:28,559 --> 00:42:29,840
who was taken hostage a few days ago?

763
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:31,920
She did stay here.

764
00:42:33,280 --> 00:42:34,199
You guys are unbelievable.

765
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:35,199
After such a major incident,

766
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,639
you waited this long to look for her?

767
00:42:37,559 --> 00:42:39,079
We just found out about it too,

768
00:42:39,280 --> 00:42:40,280
and came right over.

769
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:41,480
Where is she?

770
00:42:41,920 --> 00:42:42,559
Is she still staying here?

771
00:42:43,519 --> 00:42:44,239
You're too late.

772
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:45,360
She moved out a few days ago.

773
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:47,800
Where did she move to?

774
00:42:48,320 --> 00:42:49,599
How would I know that?

775
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:50,599
Tell you what,

776
00:42:50,920 --> 00:42:51,800
you should call the cops.

777
00:42:52,559 --> 00:42:53,599
Call the police if you need help.

778
00:42:53,920 --> 00:42:54,280
Right?

779
00:42:55,639 --> 00:42:56,119
Yeah.

780
00:43:12,760 --> 00:43:13,679
A bullet casing.

781
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:16,760
With this on, you won't fear anything.

782
00:43:17,599 --> 00:43:18,679
You just admitted it yourself

783
00:43:18,679 --> 00:43:19,920
that your mother pushed you into the river.

784
00:43:20,159 --> 00:43:21,199
Chief Ji, that's really what he just said.

785
00:43:21,199 --> 00:43:21,840
Wang Yunsheng, come here.

786
00:43:22,760 --> 00:43:23,679
The boss chewed you out, huh?

787
00:43:24,159 --> 00:43:24,719
Why?

788
00:43:25,599 --> 00:43:27,400
I have a hundred ways

789
00:43:28,320 --> 00:43:30,119
to get you and Naonao out of here.

790
00:43:30,119 --> 00:43:30,719
Do you believe me?

791
00:43:31,159 --> 00:43:32,480
He'll break if he trains any more.

792
00:43:33,119 --> 00:43:34,440
Let's just tell him to take a break.

793
00:43:34,880 --> 00:43:36,400
I can't let these kids look down on me.
